[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969880417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2969880417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2969880417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xBMdh","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T10:26:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T10:26:54Z","body":"That's because it's unique and embedded in the file, the font data has to go somewhere, to fix this you should save the font as a file instead\n\nTo avoid this you can try using `FontVariation`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969880417/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969923916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2969923916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2969923916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xBXFM","user":{"login":"OlegVegan","id":9021673,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjE2NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9021673?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegVegan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T10:45:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T10:45:58Z","body":"In my case, I had no idea why my project load time went from 3 seconds to 15 seconds. Only when I tried pushing my latest commit to GitHub it warned me about a file that's 100+ megabites now. Before that, I had no idea. Maybe there should be a warning about the size increase in the file dialogue? \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d48c69be-ebfb-4431-93d6-b350b4d89062)\n\nI thought it only makes stuff like front size, outline color unique, but the font can still be referenced by its uid. Embedding a font in a file didn't make sense to me. That's just my chain of thought","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969923916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969931636","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2969931636","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2969931636,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xBY90","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T10:48:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T10:51:26Z","body":"The font is a lot of images though, and those images are what you are making unique, as you can change them directly, the images have to go *somewhere*, making it unique means disconnecting it from the source\n\nIt might be the recursive part, which I'd suggest testing, but `FontVariation` should be the solution if you want to just change things like colors and sizes and margins, making the label settings unique without making the fonts unique will also allow you to change the settings","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969931636/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969952815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2969952815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2969952815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xBeIv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T10:53:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T10:53:48Z","body":"For a warning you also have:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/53679","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2969952815/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972322447","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2972322447","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2972322447,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xKgqP","user":{"login":"OlegVegan","id":9021673,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjE2NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9021673?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegVegan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T06:16:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T06:16:36Z","body":"> have to go _somewhere_\n\nI understand that. Nothing is free. It's just that I didn't expect that 3 clicks would cost my project to load time increase from 3 to 15 seconds. The fix was easy, I didn't need to embed the fonts.\n\nThis behavior surely looked to me as \"a flaw in a computer program that causes it to produce incorrect or unexpected results\" which is a bug to me. I just want other people not to be confused as I was.\n\nThe warning solution is great! I guess it solves the issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972322447/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972413721","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2972413721","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2972413721,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xK28Z","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T07:21:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T07:21:38Z","body":"Did you test duplicating without recursively duplicating?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972413721/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972482486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2972482486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2972482486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xLHu2","user":{"login":"OlegVegan","id":9021673,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjE2NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9021673?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegVegan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T08:38:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T08:38:34Z","body":"> Did you test duplicating without recursively duplicating?\n\nYes, It's checkmarking the font that makes the file size huge\n\n- Make LabelSettings unique is GOOD\n- Make LabelSettings unique recursively is BAD (for file size, if you checkmark the font)\n- Make LabelSettings (FontVariant) unique is GOOD\n- Make LabelSettings (FontVariant) unique recursively is GOOD (if you only checkmark FontVariant)\n- Make LabelSettings (FontVariant) unique recursively is BAD (for file size, if you include checkmark the font)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972482486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972491395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2972491395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2972491395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xLJ6D","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T08:48:05Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T08:48:05Z","body":"That sounds like expected behavior, it's doing what you are asking it to do, duplicating the font data","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972491395/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972734324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2972734324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2972734324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xMFN0","user":{"login":"OlegVegan","id":9021673,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMjE2NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9021673?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegVegan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegVegan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T12:29:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T12:29:44Z","body":"> That sounds like expected behavior, it's doing what you are asking it to do, duplicating the font data\n\nI agree 100% with you, it does what it says\n\nThe only unexpected and unwanted thing for me is its math\n\na 50 Kb font on 5 labels + 2 Kb scene = 1 Mb (in the MRP)\nor a 4Kb scene and 3 unique fonts of 50 Kb each gave me 164 MEGAbite(!) scene and a lot of headache for a day =)\nA warning that you linked is a great way to signal people about the size, so I'm happy with that","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972734324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972748073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2972748073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2972748073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xMIkp","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T12:56:30Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T12:56:30Z","body":"The fonts aren't stored in the original scene file though, they're in the imports, try saving the font separately as a `.tres` file after making it unique and the math will work out, when you use an imported font the data is stored in `.godot`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972748073/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972769680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2972769680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2972769680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xMN2Q","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T13:40:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T13:40:28Z","body":"Also to clarify, note that text formats (`.tscn`, `.tres`) take more space than binary formats (`.scn`, `.res`).\n\nFor comparison `canvas_layer.tscn` in the MRP takes 929 KB, the same scene saved as `canvas_layer.scn` takes 28 KB.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972769680/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975439957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-2975439957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107483","id":2975439957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xWZxV","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T07:42:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T07:42:20Z","body":"So to recap here:\nThe issue is that it's a bit unintuitive the way font data is handled, and it's not well documented \n\nPart of the solution is warnings for large files, this goes for other cases as well like duplicating mesh files\n\nWe should also document this in some places, a note in `Font` might be useful, maybe also in `LabelSettings` to clarify that a recursive duplication might not be desired\n\nThe final step is a bit more involved and would include making some warning for duplicating certain resources, this would require adding a bunch of new features though, but might be worth it","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2975439957/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001088076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107483#issuecomment-3